# Staged lots must be moved to their final (preference)

Standing user preference: Staged lots must be moved to their final destination or returned to secure warehouse storage within 2 hours, even if the destination tester is not yet ready.

## Conventions
- Staged lots must be moved to their final destination or returned to secure warehouse storage within 2 hours, even if the destination tester is not yet ready.

